{"author":["Elastic"],"building_block_type":"default","description":"检测构建块：可清空日志的PowerShell脚本。对应需求：防御规避。官方：PowerShell Script with Log Clear Capabilities。","from":"now-119m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.powershell*"],"interval":"60m","language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】构建块：可清空日志的PowerShell脚本","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n构建块：可清空日志的PowerShell脚本\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.eventlog.clear","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.diagnostics.eventing.reader.eventlogsession.clearlog"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"3d3aa8f9-12af-441f-9344-9f31053e316d","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 按规则数据源接入对应日志（终端、云、身份或网络）。\n2. 构建块规则用于关联，确认数据流有数据后再评估。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and\n  powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    \"Clear-EventLog\" or\n    \"Remove-EventLog\" or\n    (\"Eventing.Reader.EventLogSession\" and \".ClearLog\") or\n    (\"Diagnostics.EventLog\" and \".Clear\")\n  ) and\n  not powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    \"CmdletsToExport=@(\\\"Add-Content\\\"\"\n  ) and\n  not file.directory : \"C:\\Program Files\\WindowsAdminCenter\\PowerShellModules\\Microsoft.WindowsAdminCenter.Configuration\"\n","filters":[{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\Windows\\\\system32\\\\WindowsPowerShell\\\\v1.0\\\\Modules\\\\Microsoft.PowerShell.Management\\\\*.psd1"}}}},{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\Program Files\\\\Microsoft Monitoring Agent\\\\Agent\\\\Health Service State\\\\Resources\\\\*\\\\M365